# Custom — 开发者组合：事后 preset: custom + 能力勾选；事前 continuation 独立开关。
# 能力语义见 docs/11-runtime-plugin-capability-modes.md 与 docs/contribution.md。
agent-presets:
  default: custom
runtime-seam:
  preset: custom
  continuation: false
  authority: false
  circuitThreshold: 2
  capabilities:
    guard: true
    circuit: true
    reconcile: false
    investigate: false
    persistence: false
    query: true
    goal: false
    delta: critical
